    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this three bedroom OWN DOOR duplex to the market in the secure building of Chaplains Court, Clondalkin. Ideally located with local amenties just at your doorstep and many schools in close proximity. This property finds itself within easy reach of Clondalkin Village and its host of amenities that it has to offer including shopping centres, bars and recreational facilities. Transport links are fantastic with the bus stop moments away for W2 into Tallaght Square & G2 towards Liffey Valley Shopping Centre via the city centre. The M50 & N4 in near proximity make travelling around Dublin that much easier.\n\nBright, open and spacious living accommodation of c.90 sqm can be found here and in brief comprises of entrance hallway with downstairs family bathroom, leading onto the living room with open plan kitchen/diner. Upstairs consists of 3 spacious bedrooms, all with fitted wardrobes.  Externally this property has a communal space to the front door for all to enjoy.\n\nNo. 4 comes to the market in good condition throughout and is offered to the market with no onward chain. Due to location, price and size we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your early interest.\n\nAdditional Features:\n\n<ul>\n <li>3 BED/ 1 BATH</li>\n <li>OWN DOOR DUPLEX</li>\n <li>c. 90 sq m</li>\n <li>BER C</li>\n <li>Vacant with no onward chain</li>\n <li>Open plan kitchen/diner</li>\n <li>Spacious bedrooms with fitted wardrobes</li>\n <li>Electric storage heaters</li>\n <li>Management fee c. 2000 p/a</li>\n <li>Local amenties at your doorstep</li>\n <li>Bus stops for W2 & G2 moments away</li>\n <li>The M50 & N4 road networks in close proximity</li>\n <li>Clondalkin Village a short drive away</li>\n <li>ENQUIRIE TODAY TO BOOK A VIEWING!</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\n\nEircode = D22 PN82\n\nWalking past Supervalu, take the door on your left hand side underneath the sign “Chaplians Court D22”. Go up the stairs and through the door you will reach the landscaped communal area. No.4 is the 2nd property on your left hand side."
      },
      {
